Description: TV-first shell for a Linux HTPC (pre-alpha prototype)
 Arinn orchestrates media, applications and household HTPC sessions on Linux.
 This package ships the daemon, Qt shell, demo providers and session units.
 Autostart is opt in; see /usr/share/doc/arinn/README.md.
